Agent Platform builds on a number of third-party open-source projects,
each distributed under its own license. Notable components include:

  - Claude Agent SDK (@anthropic-ai/claude-agent-sdk) — the agent runtime
    used by worker-claude-sdk/, distributed under terms set by Anthropic.
  - SaaS Foundation — the enterprise base providing identity, authorization,
    billing, audit, LLM gateway and related capabilities, consumed through
    the foundation SDK. See https://github.com/chenzefeng09/saas-foundation
  - FastAPI, React, Vite and the wider Python and Node.js ecosystems.

